{"id":"n88011-1-8","stage":5,"title":"화살 · 箭","scene":"制度与公共事务","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n88011-1-8-1","ko":"적이 쏜 화살에 맞은 모양입니다.","zh":"看来是被敌人射出的箭击中的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"적이","meaning":"敌，敌人","explanation":"적：敌，敌人；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"적","audio":"/audio/137f8ca799a5827448b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75763","senseId":"1","lemma":"적","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"적이","audio":"/audio/f5d46a05792debdb00c3.mp3"}},{"text":"쏜","meaning":"射，打，发，放","explanation":"쏘다：射，打，发，放；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"쏘다","audio":"/audio/b4a8059171443b9b62a3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62596","senseId":"1","lemma":"쏘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쏜","audio":"/audio/6b96412d896a2a83b8ae.mp3"}},{"text":"화살에","meaning":"箭，矢","explanation":"화살：箭，矢；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"화살","audio":"/audio/b0375b0cd1a5ad848444.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88011","senseId":"1","lemma":"화살","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"화살에","audio":"/audio/c8b9eac865878131c765.mp3"}},{"text":"맞은","meaning":"打中，被打中","explanation":"맞다：打中，被打中；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"맞다","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66233","senseId":"3","lemma":"맞다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맞은","audio":"/audio/da7fb4ac2f316483617b.mp3"}},{"text":"모양입니다.","meaning":"像，好像","explanation":"모양：像，好像；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"모양","audio":"/audio/f1cd655a5837981f96d3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62398","senseId":"1","lemma":"모양","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모양입니다","audio":"/audio/044577de052e0e3b76c6.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"137f8ca799a58274","term":"적","zh":"敌，敌人","audio":"/audio/137f8ca799a5827448b3.mp3","entryId":"75763","definition":"互相争斗或意欲谋害的对方。","pronunciation":["적"]},{"id":"b4a8059171443b9b","term":"쏘다","zh":"射，打，发，放","audio":"/audio/b4a8059171443b9b62a3.mp3","entryId":"62596","definition":"使某个物体用力飞到目标。","pronunciation":["쏘ː다"]},{"id":"b0375b0cd1a5ad84","term":"화살","zh":"箭，矢","audio":"/audio/b0375b0cd1a5ad848444.mp3","entryId":"88011","definition":"把弓弦拉得紧绷绷的，借其弹力飞得较远的尖头杆子。","pronunciation":["화살"]},{"id":"6d08580e9b088153","term":"맞다","zh":"打中，被打中","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3","entryId":"66233","definition":"射出或扔出的物体碰触到其它物体上；或被使得碰触到其它物体。","pronunciation":["맏따"]},{"id":"f1cd655a5837981f","term":"모양","zh":"像，好像","audio":"/audio/f1cd655a5837981f96d3.mp3","entryId":"62398","definition":"表示估计或推测。","pronunciation":["모양"]}],"audio":"/audio/c8ec4af75c86629d4ca8.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n88011-1-8-2","ko":"피가 많이 나니 어서 치료를 해야겠군.","zh":"血流得这么多，得赶紧治疗才行。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"피가","meaning":"血，血液","explanation":"피：血，血液；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"피","audio":"/audio/9c6661386be05570418b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73269","senseId":"1","lemma":"피","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"피가","audio":"/audio/0b0dd30901a0cfbac4b8.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"나니","meaning":"流","explanation":"나다：流；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"18","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나니","audio":"/audio/88a4cd9278876b125566.mp3"}},{"text":"어서","meaning":"快","explanation":"어서：快","readings":[{"term":"어서","audio":"/audio/596b9885add9128d0c53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67026","senseId":"1","lemma":"어서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어서","audio":"/audio/596b9885add9128d0c53.mp3"}},{"text":"치료를","meaning":"治疗","explanation":"치료：治疗；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"치료","audio":"/audio/6f44a9c1f36d86e996c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83170","senseId":"1","lemma":"치료","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"치료를","audio":"/audio/8d768130adca62c12574.mp3"}},{"text":"해야겠군.","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；군：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해야겠군","audio":"/audio/54df62861df3f6ce5bd4.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9c6661386be05570","term":"피","zh":"血，血液","audio":"/audio/9c6661386be05570418b.mp3","entryId":"73269","definition":"循环于人或动物体内血管的红色液体，其作用为供给氧气和养分、运输排泄物等。","pronunciation":["피"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"流","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"身上流出汗、血、泪水等。","pronunciation":["나다"]},{"id":"596b9885add9128d","term":"어서","zh":"快","audio":"/audio/596b9885add9128d0c53.mp3","entryId":"67026","definition":"用于催促做事或行动。","pronunciation":["어서"]},{"id":"6f44a9c1f36d86e9","term":"치료","zh":"治疗","audio":"/audio/6f44a9c1f36d86e996c7.mp3","entryId":"83170","definition":"治愈疾病或伤口等。","pronunciation":["치료"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/53537d7a5a2e5b012c2c.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.169,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=88011","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":151,"sequenceScore":2.9957,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["血流得这么多，得赶紧治疗才行。","看来是被敌人射出的箭击中的。","活动办得顺利吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["看来是被敌人射出的箭击中的。","活动办得顺利吗？","血流得这么多，得赶紧治疗才行。"],"answer":2}]}
